      "writtenOn": "2018-07-06T00:05:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Suggest:\n\n\"Keystone cannot start due to project hierarchical depth in the current deployment `%(max_depth_found)s` (project_id: %(project_id)s) exceeds the enforcement model\u0027s maximum limit of %(max_limit_depth)s. Please use a different enforcement model to correct the issue\".\n\nWe need to provide information where the depth was too much, what the max depth found was, and what the enforcement model\u0027s max depth is.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 362,
        "startChar": 24,
        "endLine": 366,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "27a45216b115c3681d9bd44b50491fee8fd4e26a",
